  unitName: Azure Warrior Lucina
  unitId: 20364
  unitNumber: 534
  description: A knight sworn to the Sama Kingdom. Her father started a civil war
    there, in hopes to purge the navy of its corruption. Unbeknownst to them, he
    was playing into the hands of their rival kingdom. Lucina and Selena spared no
    effort in trying to rescue him from the ravages of war. However, he vanished
    leaving a mysterious letter--one with the whereabouts of the mother she assumed
    to be dead.
  summonDesc: My blade has its faults.<br>And so do I. If we're a burden,<br>get
    rid of us both.
  fusionDesc: Brute force isn't perfect.<br>But it's all I know.<br>No more denying
    that.
  evoDesc: Something inside me is...<br>waking up...<br>What is this feeling?
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
